<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Votre impact du mois</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f0fdf4;">

  <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background-color: #f0fdf4;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 40px 20px;">

        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.07); overflow: hidden;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #065f46 0%, #10b981 100%); padding: 48px 32px; text-align: center;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #a7f3d0; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 600;">Votre bilan mensuel</p>
              <h1 style="margin: 0; color: #ffffff; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700;">Votre impact environnemental</h1>
              <p style="margin: 12px 0 0; color: #a7f3d0; font-size: 16px;">{{month}} {{year}}</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Greeting -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 32px 32px 0;">
              <p style="margin: 0; color: #374151; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
                Bonjour <strong>{{firstName}}</strong>,
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 12px 0 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;">
                Grâce à votre engagement chez Earthway, vous avez contribué à protéger notre planète ce mois-ci. Voici un récapitulatif de votre impact cumulé.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Impact Stats Grid -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 28px 32px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%">
                <tr>
                  <!-- Trees -->
                  <td width="50%" style="padding: 0 8px 16px 0; vertical-align: top;">
                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5 0%, #a7f3d0 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
                      <div style="font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 8px;">🌳</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #065f46;">{{treesPlanted}}</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #047857; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px;">arbres financés</div>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                  <!-- Corals -->
                  <td width="50%" style="padding: 0 0 16px 8px; vertical-align: top;">
                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeafe 0%, #bfdbfe 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
                      <div style="font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 8px;">🪸</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #1e40af;">{{coralsRestored}}</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #1d4ed8; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px;">coraux restaurés</div>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <!-- Pollinators -->
                  <td width="50%" style="padding: 0 8px 0 0; vertical-align: top;">
                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fde68a 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
                      <div style="font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 8px;">🐝</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #92400e;">{{pollinatorsHelped}}</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #b45309; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px;">pollinisateurs protégés</div>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                  <!-- CO2 -->
                  <td width="50%" style="padding: 0 0 0 8px; vertical-align: top;">
                    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f3e8ff 0%, #e9d5ff 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; text-align: center;">
                      <div style="font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 8px;">🌍</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 28px; font-weight: 700; color: #6b21a8;">{{co2Offset}} kg</div>
                      <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #7c3aed; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 4px;">CO₂ compensé</div>
                    </div>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Total Contribution -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 32px 28px;">
              <div style="background-color: #f9fafb; border-left: 4px solid #10b981; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #374151; font-size: 15px;">
                  💚 <strong>Contribution totale :</strong> <span style="color: #059669; font-weight: 700;">{{totalDonated}} €</span>
                  &nbsp;·&nbsp; Niveau <span style="color: #059669; font-weight: 700;">{{level}}</span> — <em>{{levelTitle}}</em>
                </p>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Subscription info -->
          {{#if subscriptionTier}}
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 32px 28px;">
              <div style="background-color: #ecfdf5; border: 1px solid #6ee7b7; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;">
                <p style="margin: 0 0 4px; color: #065f46; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px;">
                  Abonnement actif
                </p>
                <p style="margin: 0; color: #374151; font-size: 15px;">
                  Plan <strong>{{subscriptionTier}}</strong> — Votre abonnement amplifie votre impact grâce au multiplicateur Earthway.
                </p>
              </div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          {{/if}}

          <!-- Motivation message -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 32px 28px;">
              <p style="margin: 0; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; font-style: italic; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6; padding-top: 24px;">
                "Chaque action, aussi petite soit-elle, contribue à un monde plus sain. Merci de faire partie de l'aventure Earthway." 🌿
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- CTA -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 0 32px 40px; text-align: center;">
              <a href="{{profileUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #059669 100%); color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(16,185,129,0.3);">
                Voir mon tableau de bord
              </a>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 20px 32px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
              <p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">
                Vous recevez cet email car vous êtes abonné(e) aux récapitulatifs d'impact mensuels.
              </p>
              <p style="margin: 0; color: #9ca3af; font-size: 12px;">
                <a href="{{preferencesUrl}}" style="color: #10b981; text-decoration: none;">Gérer mes préférences email</a>
                &nbsp;·&nbsp;
                <a href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}" style="color: #9ca3af; text-decoration: underline;">Se désabonner</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
